  "habitat": "Sealed under the Salt Pit: the old adit at the bottom of the terraces (not placed yet; the adit stays sealed)",
  "lore": "PROVISIONAL. The thing the miners sealed the adit on. A Burrowborn worm as long as a haul truck, its hide gone grey with brine; the Brine Scorpions on the flats are its brood's leftovers. It hunts by vibration and moves through salt as if it were water.",
