    "BURROW",
    "EMERGE",
    "SWEEP",
    "SPIT",
    "GEYSER"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "Keep your distance and it dives: the ground cracks in a red ring under your feet. Move before it fills: the Wyrm comes up there.",
    "While it is under the salt your blows barely reach it.",
    "At range it rears and spits brine along a green line: step off the line.",
    "Up close its body sweeps a wide red arc.",
    "Wounded to half, it rears and slams: brine geysers burst in red rings along its aim."
  ],
